From 283a895f0f7e6e3f95e85e770e55ebc607fb204a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meysam82003 <meysamsalamatnasab@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 12:24:43 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(browser): complete browser surface - insets, premium UI,
 real route, downloads, private hardening

P0 WindowInsets: toolbar and bottom bar track systemBars + displayCutout +
IME on every orientation; controls never hide under status/gesture bars.
Premium navy/gold/ivory chrome: rounded address pill with lock indicator,
clear button and subtle gold progress line; vector icon set; adaptive
bottom action bar; professional tab switcher; premium start page with
escaped inputs; local error pages with retry/back/home.

BrowserRouteManager (DIRECT / BROWSER_ONLY / FULL_DEVICE) reports honest
states only. BROWSER_ONLY starts the Ghajar core with a localhost SOCKS
inbound only (no tun) via the app-registered route engine and routes
WebView traffic through androidx.webkit ProxyController; when the
device-wide VPN is running it refuses instead of killing the tunnel.

Download manager: broadcast handoff persists requests, foreground queue
(max 3 concurrent), HTTP Range probe with 1/2/4/8 segments and automatic
single-stream fallback, cooperative pause/resume/retry/cancel, SHA-256
digest, atomic JSON persistence, duplicate-name resolution, process-death
recovery, native downloads page with live progress, share and delete.

Media action sheet (play/download/info) with DRM rejection. Private mode:
ephemeral webkit profile (MULTI_PROFILE), full session wipe on last
private tab close, no history/tab persistence for private tabs.
